sequenceDiagram
    participant CFG as mcp_servers.json
    participant MCP as MCPManager
    participant SRV as MCP Server Process
    participant TOOL as ToolRegistry
    participant LLM3 as LLM

    Note over CFG: {"servers": [{name, command, args, env}]}
    MCP->>CFG: Read server configs at startup
    MCP->>SRV: Spawn subprocess (uvx / npx / python)
    Note over MCP,SRV: Connection timeout: 15s
    SRV-->>MCP: MCP handshake
    MCP->>SRV: List tools
    SRV-->>MCP: [tool1, tool2, ...]
    MCP-->>TOOL: Register tools from server

    Note over MCP: Logs: "MCP server 'weather' connected with N tools"

    LLM3->>TOOL: Tool call request {name, args}
    TOOL->>MCP: dispatch_tool_call(server, tool, args)
    MCP->>SRV: MCP call_tool {name, arguments}
    Note over MCP,SRV: Tool call timeout: 10s
    SRV-->>MCP: Tool result
    MCP-->>LLM3: Result content

    Note over SRV: On timeout: return error to LLM\nOn disconnect: mark unavailable\nRetry on next call